940;45089;%4%1 - Mod:%2 - Ch:%3 Local bus error - timeout (Break) (B021);1. I/O module faulty%CrLf%2. Cabling in front of specified I/O modules faulty%CrLf%3. I/O module defective;1. Acknowledge fault, in case of repeated occurrence restart Sercos bus at vision system. %CrLf%2. Replace cabling%CrLf%3. Replace module specified in error report, in case of repeated occurrence of the error replace the module before that.%CrLf%%CrLf%Advice for B021 Errors with the localization information Mod1:%CrLf%Due to limitations in the CTEI bus diagnostic itLs possible that in a few situations the localization information Mod1 is not correct.%CrLf%If the CTEI Gateway and module 1 and the CTEI cable between these modules have been replaced and the error still occurs the next step is to replace all the CTEI modules and CTEI cables that are behind module 1 in the CTEI bus.%CrLf%
