940;45104;%4%1 - Mod:%2 - Ch:%3 Local bus configuration error (B030);1. Replacement of a live FESTO I/O module%CrLf%2. Configuration of the I/O modules at the gateway does not agree with the real design.%CrLf%3. Restart of the local bus (CTEI) failed.;1. Switch RCMP to idle and wait until controller switches off. After that, reconnect voltage at RCMP. %CrLf%2. Compare installed I/O modules with required configuration (wiring diagram). Switch RCMP to idle, eliminate differences and then reconnect voltage at RCMP. %CrLf%3. Switch RCMP to idle and wait until controller switches off. After that, reconnect voltage at RCMP.
