3500;40550;TriggerOverflow: task %1, res %2;A task was activated while its old cycle was still running.;Increase cycletime of task, optimize code.
3500;40551;RuntimeOverflow: task %1, res %2;The runtime of a task's cycle has expired, although the code was not completely executed.;Increse the task's cycletime, optimze the code.
3500;40552;RuntimeError: task %1, res %2, fu %3, errId %4;A runtime error occured in the system.;Terminate error in the application.
3500;40553;Exception: task %1, res %2, fu %3, excType %4;An error in the IEC application occured.;Terminate error in IEC application.
