3700;256;%1 (%2/%3): LOCK prematurely lifted;A locked routine has been unlocked without an explicit UNLOCK-statement.The reason can be: Exceedance of the allowed run time, not allowed statment (e.g. WAIT) or debug breaks.;Check the statement in the locked area.
