6653;1;%1: Could not open Sercos3-FPGA-file '%2';The Sercos3-FPGA-file needed for updating could not be opened;Contact distributor
6653;2;%1: Update of Sercos3-FPGA failed (error code %2);Update of Sercos3-FPGA failed;Contact distributor
6653;3;%1: Trying to load supported Sercos3-FPGA;As the currently loaded Sercos3-FPGA-version is not supported, it is tried to load a Sercos3-FPGA-version which is compatible with the firmware.;not available
6653;4;%1: Sercos3-FPGA updated successfully;Automatic update of Sercos3-FPGA-version completed successfully.;not available
6653;5;%1: Power off the control and restart (Sercos3-FPGA updated);Automatic update of Sercos3-FPGA completed successfully but new FPGA could not be initialized automatically. Therefore a cold start of the control is necessary.;Shut down the control, switch off power, switch on power, restart the control
6653;6;%1: Restart Firmware (Sercos3-FPGA updated);Restart of firmware needed in order to use SERCOS-bus again.;Restart firmware.
6653;7;%1: Incompatible version %2 of sercos3-FPGA;Incompatible sercos3-FPGA. No automatic update available, it may be necessary to update the FPGA as part of another FPGA (f.e. System-FPGA).;Manual Update of another FPGA (f.e. System-FPGA) necessary.
